oppressive/offensive can this be?  Do people feel torment when they read
about the Booper County Rebels basketball team?  Do they feel anguish
when the cheer "Go, Rebels!" is raised at a basketball game?  I could
understand offense at the display of the Confederate flag, but the mere
nickname "Rebels"?  Yeesh.
 
